1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,079
This video shows how Scheduling connects to the rest of your site:

2
00:00:05,079 --> 00:00:08,025
workflows that react to appointments, the A.I.

3
00:00:08,025 --> 00:00:12,501
tools that let an assistant book for customers, how to copy scheduling to

4
00:00:12,501 --> 00:00:16,240
another site, and what to check when something doesn't work.

5
00:00:20,845 --> 00:00:25,563
With the Workflows feature on, open Workflows and choose Create Workflow.

6
00:00:25,563 --> 00:00:29,505
Give it a name, such as Confirmed appointments, and save it.

7
00:00:29,956 --> 00:00:33,134
The editor lists its activities by category.

8
00:00:33,134 --> 00:00:35,359
Open the Scheduling category.

9
00:00:35,359 --> 00:00:42,986
Its events are Appointment Requested, Confirmed, Rescheduled, Cancelled, Completed and Marked No-Show, Reservation

10
00:00:42,986 --> 00:00:46,036
Hold Expired, and Waitlist Slot Available.

11
00:00:46,486 --> 00:00:49,618
Click Appointment Confirmed to start the workflow with it.

12
00:00:49,618 --> 00:00:53,287
In its settings, you can limit it to some appointment types, and left

13
00:00:53,287 --> 00:00:55,146
empty it applies to all of them.

14
00:00:55,598 --> 00:00:58,139
The same category has the tasks:

15
00:00:58,139 --> 00:01:04,024
find open times, book, confirm, reschedule and cancel an appointment, get one, and

16
00:01:04,024 --> 00:01:06,498
add a customer to the waitlist.

17
00:01:06,950 --> 00:01:11,768
Together they send a confirmation email when an appointment is confirmed, a text

18
00:01:11,768 --> 00:01:15,858
message an hour before it starts, or an email to a waiting customer

19
00:01:15,858 --> 00:01:17,370
when a time frees up.

20
00:01:21,579 --> 00:01:27,032
With Scheduling and AI Services both on, an AI assistant can book appointments.

21
00:01:27,032 --> 00:01:32,549
Open Artificial Intelligence, Profiles, choose Add Profile, and start a profile.

22
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:37,100
On the Capabilities tab, the Tools list has a Scheduling group:

23
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:42,685
List appointment types, Find appointment slots, Book appointment and Change appointment.

24
00:01:42,685 --> 00:01:45,240
Tick the ones this assistant may use.

25
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:52,089
The assistant lists only the appointment types that customers can book themselves, finds

26
00:01:52,089 --> 00:01:53,876
open times, and books one.

27
00:01:53,876 --> 00:01:58,231
To move or cancel an appointment, the customer gives the code from their

28
00:01:58,231 --> 00:02:01,860
manage link, or the email or phone number they booked with.

29
00:02:06,062 --> 00:02:11,441
To copy scheduling to another site, open Tools, Deployments, Plans, and create a plan.

30
00:02:11,441 --> 00:02:16,586
Add the Calendars step first, with Include events, so the resources' calendars and

31
00:02:16,586 --> 00:02:19,042
the appointments' events come along.

32
00:02:21,527 --> 00:02:23,596
Then add the Scheduling step.

33
00:02:23,596 --> 00:02:27,913
It takes the appointment types and the people, rooms and equipment.

34
00:02:27,913 --> 00:02:33,707
Tick Include appointments for every appointment, with the customers' names, emails and phone

35
00:02:33,707 --> 00:02:37,077
numbers, and Include the waitlist for the waitlist.

36
00:02:37,528 --> 00:02:42,502
Importing creates what is missing and updates what is there, matched by id.

37
00:02:42,502 --> 00:02:46,063
Customers' links to move or cancel are not exported:

38
00:02:46,063 --> 00:02:49,748
an imported appointment keeps the link it already had.

39
00:02:53,948 --> 00:02:55,418
No times are offered?

40
00:02:55,418 --> 00:03:00,429
Check that the appointment type has resources, that they take appointments, that their

41
00:03:00,429 --> 00:03:04,350
hours cover the day, and that the day is within the minimum notice

42
00:03:04,350 --> 00:03:05,875
and the booking limit.

43
00:03:05,875 --> 00:03:08,708
Something busy on a calendar closes times too.

44
00:03:09,458 --> 00:03:11,381
The booking page isn't found?

45
00:03:11,381 --> 00:03:15,997
The appointment type needs Can be booked, Customers can book it themselves and

46
00:03:15,997 --> 00:03:20,448
a Booking page address, and the Scheduling Self-Service feature must be on.

47
00:03:21,198 --> 00:03:24,085
A staff member with shifts is never offered?

48
00:03:24,085 --> 00:03:28,646
Their Shift calendar must be chosen, and the Shift events there must name

49
00:03:28,646 --> 00:03:30,148
them as an attendee.

50
00:03:32,148 --> 00:03:36,912
Workflows tell your customers, the AI assistant books for them, and a deployment

51
00:03:36,912 --> 00:03:39,127
plan moves it all to another site.

52
00:03:39,127 --> 00:03:40,568
Thanks for watching.

